  19:     Select the majority interior marker color, then redraw the framed board as that color's frame plus its bounding-box outline.
  20: 
  21:     Input structure:
  22:     - The top row is a copied palette made from adjacent equal color pairs.
  23:     - Below it is a one-cell-thick rectangular frame around a black interior.
  24:     - Non-black, non-frame interior pixels are marker colors; one marker color has
